WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.965
Recon starts with hypotheses and questions.

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:05.958
Convert the request into
the decision it creates.

00:00:06.028 --> 00:00:11.660
Identify who can decide, who experiences
consequences, who knows the workflow, and who

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:15.101
benefits. These roles often
belong to different people.

00:00:15.171 --> 00:00:18.499
Find previous attempts
before proposing a solution.

00:00:18.569 --> 00:00:22.835
Distinguish physical constraints
from political conditions and habits.

00:00:22.905 --> 00:00:24.271
A habit may change.

00:00:24.341 --> 00:00:29.909
A permission requirement still governs your
action even when it is organizational rather than

00:00:29.979 --> 00:00:30.981
physical.

00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:33.078
A sponsor says, build AI.

00:00:33.148 --> 00:00:35.665
Maya says, reduce repeated triage.

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:37.869
Luis owns the ticket API.

00:00:37.939 --> 00:00:39.773
Priya approves data access.

00:00:39.843 --> 00:00:46.179
Agents explain why the previous automation failed:
it sent plausible but incorrect replies and

00:00:46.249 --> 00:00:47.892
increased their checking work.

00:00:47.962 --> 00:00:52.741
Pause the video and complete this exercise
before opening the worked response.

00:00:52.811 --> 00:00:56.608
Write a draft decision statement
and five discovery questions.

00:00:56.678 --> 00:00:58.918
Keep the proposed solution provisional.

00:00:58.988 --> 00:01:04.599
Decision: should Northstar test routing assistance
to reduce review effort while preserving

00:01:04.669 --> 00:01:05.863
human approval?

00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:11.565
Ask where review time accumulates, how categories
are chosen, what caused prior errors, who

00:01:11.635 --> 00:01:14.835
can authorize data, and how
success will be observed.

00:01:14.905 --> 00:01:17.081
This draft can change during immersion.

00:01:17.151 --> 00:01:21.567
It is narrower and more testable
than a commitment to an AI assistant.

00:01:21.637 --> 00:01:23.728
Which is a useful Recon output?

00:01:23.798 --> 00:01:26.529
A. A provisional decision and questions B.

00:01:26.599 --> 00:01:28.263
A fixed architecture C.

00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:29.975
A promised savings figure.

00:01:30.045 --> 00:01:31.496
The best answer is A.

00:01:31.566 --> 00:01:35.790
Recon supplies a starting
hypothesis for field investigation.
